  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Corporate Volunteering Hub (CVH) Seed Funding</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Corporate Volunteering Hub will mobilise business skills through corporate volunteering at a scale that will drive improvements in the performance of development programmes and in the lives of poor and marginalised people, through: sustained improvement in the delivery of services and products to poor and marginalised groups by partner organisations; changes in the behaviours of business in ways which benefit poor and marginalised groups; and greater understanding in the private sector of the challenges and opportunities of working in a development context.</narrative>
  </description>
